T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Flagship credit facility offering loans from Rs. 5 Lakh up to Rs. 20 Lakh \(Tarun) Tj
T*
(Plus\) for scaling mature micro businesses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Established micro and small business units requiring higher capital for) Tj
T*
(   scaling.) Tj
T*
(2. Loan requirement between Rs. 5,00,000 and Rs. 10,00,000 \(and up to Rs. 20 Lakh) Tj
T*
(   under Tarun Plus for previous borrowers who successfully repaid Tarun) Tj
T*
(   loans\).) Tj
T*
(3. Documented operating history of at least 1-2 years with positive cash) Tj
T*
(   flows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Credit facility from Rs. 5 Lakh up to Rs. 20 Lakh without collateral) Tj
T*
(   requirement.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 20.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. GST Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. Udyam Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(3. Audited Balance Sheet and P&L for last 2 years) Tj
T*
(4. ITR Returns \(last 2 years\) along with computation of income) Tj
